---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Product Image Sources & Permissions"
  description="Original manufacturer product images, Tagrivo studio compositions and unchanged Brother library photographs. Source links and photo-rights limitations."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-heading">
      <h1>
        Product images,
        <br />
        <em>with a clear source.</em>
      </h1>
      <p>
        Reviewed November 5, 2026. A photograph establishes appearance, not tested performance.
        Specifications are researched separately.
      </p>
    </header>
    <article class="prose" style="padding-bottom:70px">
      <h2>Brother QL-1100 and QL-1110NWB</h2>
      <p>
        Official product photographs from the{' '}
        <a href="https://www.brother.ca/en/media-room" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Brother Canada Marketing Library
        </a>
        , displayed to promote the corresponding Brother products. The{' '}
        <a
          href="https://www.brother.ca/cms/files/Brother_Canada_Logo_Guidelines_EN.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          library usage terms
        </a>{' '}
        restrict use to Brother promotion and prohibit changes to the materials. We preserve the
        original image files and proportions; no product retouching, invented angles or background
        generation is used.
      </p>
      <p>
        QL-1100 is the original model, not QL-1100c. QL-1110NWB is not QL-1110NWBc. Each currently
        has one authorized view; we do not fill a gallery with manufactured perspectives. Brother
        retains ownership. Standalone corporate logo use has separate approval requirements; we do
        not use standalone brand artwork.
      </p>
      <h2>Rollo, MUNBYN and Phomemo</h2>
      <p>
        Product compositions use the original manufacturer image of the named model. Tagrivo changes
        the studio surroundings; logos, controls and hardware are not generated. Additional views
        use real separate images or clearly described detail crops, not invented perspectives. The
        manufacturer retains ownership of its source material.
      </p>
      <p>
        Commercial reuse and editing authorization for these source images has not been established.
        The studio edits do not create a photo-use license or imply manufacturer endorsement. Source
        pages: <a href="https://www.rollo.com/product/rollo-wireless-printer/">Rollo X1040</a>,{' '}
        <a href="https://www.rollo.com/product/rollo-printer/">Rollo X1038</a>,{' '}
        <a href="https://pos.munbyn.com/munbyn-itpp941-series-thermal-label-printer/">
          MUNBYN ITPP941
        </a>
        ,{' '}
        <a href="https://munbyn.com/products/bluetooth-thermal-label-printer-941b">
          MUNBYN ITPP941B
        </a>{' '}
        and <a href="https://phomemo.com/products/pm-241bt">Phomemo PM241-BT</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>Other editorial artwork</h2>
      <p>
        The existing Tagrivo hero is original category artwork. It is not an exact product
        photograph. No category diagram or generated artwork is declared as a real printer image in
        Product structured data.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="/printers/">Explore the catalog</a> ·{' '}
        <a href="/methodology/">Read our research methodology</a> ·{' '}
        <a href="/contact/">Send a correction</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
